Simplest: at ≤720px, display corner-buttons vertically on the LEFT edge at top, below the landmark counter (counter is top-left). Actually move counter top-left is at left 14 top 2; buttons row below it (top: 56px, flex-direction: column, left side). Let me do: 
```
